    "bleelblep.screenshot-redactor-legacy": {
      "name": "Screenshot Redactor (Legacy)",
      "description": "Pre-347 build, kept for Discord versions older than 347 only — install Screenshot Redactor instead. A toggle that replaces usernames and avatars with stable placeholders, so a conversation can be screenshotted without doxxing anyone. The thread still reads in order — the same person keeps the same placeholder.",
