    "bleelblep.translate": {
      "name": "Translate",
      "description": "Long-press any message to translate it in place, and long-press again to put it back. Optionally translates everything not already in your language as it arrives. Four keyless services behind it — Google, Bing, Yandex and MyMemory — tried in turn, so one going down does not take the plugin with it. No key, no account, no AI.",
